Upstream-Name: scx
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/sched-ext/scx/issues
Source: https://github.com/sched-ext/scx/tree/v1.1.4
Comment: The release tarball and the vendored crates are listed with
 their SHA-256 in scx.sha256. Only scx_lavd and scx_bpfland are built;
 the crates they link are listed below by licence. The crates are the
 ones in the release's Cargo.lock, unchanged.

